@startuml eviction-checkpoint-flow
' ============================================================================
' eviction-checkpoint-flow.puml — checkpoint() rebuilds the DiskRegistry atomically.
' Replaces the ASCII checkpoint-integration flow in docs/persistence/eviction.md.
' Color key (persistence accents):  indigo = checkpoint trigger
'             blue = on-disk serialization steps   teal = the atomic coordinator swap
' ============================================================================
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #37474F
skinparam TitleFontSize 15

title checkpoint() — rebuild the on-disk registry atomically

start
:**checkpoint()**;<<#C5CAE9>>
:**Serialize Trie to Disk**\nDFS traversal — write nodes to disk;<<#BBDEFB>>
:**Build New DiskRegistry**\nper node written:\nregistry.register(path, disk_ptr, size, depth, type);<<#BBDEFB>>
:**Update Coordinator**\ncoordinator.update_disk_registry(new_registry)\nreplaces old registry atomically;<<#B2DFDB>>
stop
@enduml
